          "content": "Nick Kozyrev — editable portfolio draft\n28 routes × desktop/mobile. Text, images and containers are separate layers.\nOriginal browser screenshots are alongside each page. GRID GUIDES are hidden groups.\nNative Pencil rendering is not yet verified. Video layers are static frames.\nInstall the bundled Inter Tight fonts before reviewing typography."
