                                      "children": [
                                        {
                                          "id": "news--the-aesthetics-of-technology-1440-n33",
                                          "type": "text",
                                          "name": "Artificial intelligence is no longer a tool but a collaborat",
                                          "content": "Artificial intelligence is no longer a tool but a collaborator. In digital art and design, machines generate, assist, and sometimes surprise their creators. Sonori’s recent experiments with AI-driven motion explore how algorithms interpret human intent — creating forms that feel both precise and unpredictable.",
                                          "x": 0,
                                          "y": 2,
                                          "width": 556.625,
