                                        {
                                          "id": "news--human-machines-390-n22",
                                          "type": "text",
                                          "name": "In the new frontier of creative technology, design and code ",
                                          "content": "In the new frontier of creative technology, design and code have merged into a single expressive medium. What was once purely functional — lines of code, motion triggers, system logic — is now a field for artistic emotion. Studios like Sonori are at the edge of this transformation, where the digital becomes tactile, and interaction becomes feeling.",
                                          "x": 0,
                                          "y": 1,
