                                        {
                                          "id": "news--human-machines-390-n39",
                                          "type": "text",
                                          "name": "Sonori explores this language through subtle interaction: an",
                                          "content": "Sonori explores this language through subtle interaction: animations that respond to gaze, sound that reacts to scroll, microdelays that mirror human rhythm. Each digital space becomes a stage for perception — invisible, yet emotionally charged.",
                                          "x": 0,
                                          "y": 1,
