                                          "id": "news--generative-design-1440-n33",
                                          "type": "text",
                                          "name": "The screen is dissolving. Boundaries between digital and phy",
                                          "content": "The screen is dissolving. Boundaries between digital and physical are vanishing as augmented environments and interactive installations redefine how design is experienced. Sonori’s work with hybrid media explores this tension — where projection, motion, and architecture merge into seamless presence.",
