                                      "children": [
                                        {
                                          "id": "news--generative-design-1440-n35",
                                          "type": "text",
                                          "name": "The future of design lies in multi-sensory storytelling. Ima",
                                          "content": "The future of design lies in multi-sensory storytelling. Imagine walking into a space where sound and light respond to your pace, where websites expand into environments, and interfaces become spatial. These experiences turn audiences into participants, blending cinematic choreography with spatial design.",
