                                        {
                                          "id": "news--beyond-the-screen-390-n26",
                                          "type": "text",
                                          "name": "The era of generative design challenges authorship and contr",
                                          "content": "The era of generative design challenges authorship and control. It asks designers to let go — to trust code as a collaborator. It’s a new form of artistry defined not by precision, but by permission.",
