                                      "children": [
                                        {
                                          "id": "works--rik-showreels-390-n29",
                                          "type": "text",
                                          "name": "For both pieces, I developed the storyboard and visual direc",
                                          "content": "For both pieces, I developed the storyboard and visual direction, selected and arranged the shots, and handled the animation, editing, visual effects, and sound design. The first focused on 2D motion, while the second explored a more experimental digital language combining 3D elements, ASCII-style graphics, and a Windows XP-inspired opening. The second showreel was later presented at Comic-Con 2025.",
