                                          "name": "I adapted and animated the four pieces, making small creativ",
                                          "content": "I adapted and animated the four pieces, making small creative adjustments and shaping a consistent motion language across the series. The videos covered projects for Zenit × Punk Lab, EasyCheck × Punk Lab, and Expert Solutions × Punk Lab, using simple 2D motion, transitions, and lightweight UI animation where needed.",
